# isoloom targets
✗ cloud-vm (no cloud can run it (aws: machine `ws-01`: no AWS image for `windows-11` yet (Debian 12/13, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Windows Server 2016 to 2025); azure: machine `ws-01`: no Azure image for `windows-11` yet (Debian 12/13, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Windows Server 2016 to 2025); gcp: machine `dc01`: Windows on GCP comes later; digitalocean: DigitalOcean cloud-vm takes one machine on one network: a droplet joins one VPC, at a private address DigitalOcean picks, so other machines couldn't reach it at its spec address; linode: machine `web01` is on several networks: a Linode instance has one VPC interface; oci: Oracle Cloud cloud-vm is Linux only so far))

# isoloom generate --target cloud-vm (exit 1)
